msgstr "只有信用冻结的订单才能被解除冻结。"

#. module: sale_credit_hold
#: code:model=sale.order,name:sale_credit_hold.models.sale_order
msgid ""
"You cannot change a credit-held order to sale state. Use the 'Release "
